  "original_constructor_contract": [
    "World-placement directory and streams parsed by existing hash-bound starglider2_world_maps.audit; only aliases8..14 contain types22/44.",
    "Their stream contains12 repetitions of one22 and five44; both original initializer directory entries match their accepted routine addresses.",
    "Each consumes velocity_z,velocity_x,rotation1 WORDs and advances the source cursor6bytes. Group initializer subtracts2000 from shared worldY, then copies it to the object; truck uses currentY.",
    "Truck links current+38 to previous object, previous+3C to current and advances the workspace tail. Existing SG2WorldObject+38/+3C remain unions for other types."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Original constructor prefix only; inventory release also dispatches through this directory and is not bounded here. No arbitrary extra calls or all-writer guarantee.",
    "No live tug/model-instance observation or visual identity proof. Names are existing original catalogue identities correlated with exact callback entries.",
    "The two following zero bytes are not declared a sentinel or consumed by these72 reads.",
    "Original USP scratch use, signed arithmetic, unchecked types and end-to-end gameplay behavior remain unmodified."
  ],
